    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: c7086534fcbc9eb061a30c5bc62cb3b108e8844b -->\n**Review (M3), docs/process-only: Needs changes before merge.**\n\nThe content is correct. Both rows match the shipped tools on main (`crates/app/src/mcp/order_tools.rs:22-23`): `rename_operation {name, new_name}` and `reorder_operation {name, target, place?}`, one undo step each, with moves between setups refused. The \"Shipped via\" line is right too.\n\n**Blocking:**\n1. **PROCESS_VERSION is stale.** The PR sets 21, but upstream/main is now at 25, so the bump would go backwards. Merge main and set it above every number in use. Main is at 25 and open PRs hold 26-31, so 32 is free; it renumbers at merge anyway.\n2. **It conflicts with main** (`git merge-tree` reports a conflict, almost certainly PROCESS_VERSION and/or SKILL.md, which other PRs have edited since). Merge main into the branch, keeping both sides' SKILL.md rows.\n\nNo build was needed (docs and a process file only). Turned back into a draft for the fix.\n",
